flowchart TD
    A["Resolve action; show wordmark for start/resume/settings/setup/status"] --> B{"Requested action"}
    B -->|Help or status| C["Read and report only; leave active work running"]
    B -->|Settings or setup| D["Handle project choices only; no team start"]
    B -->|Pause or resume| E["Bare action: picker first; All controls run and offered teams"]
    E -->|Project resume after evidence checks| F
    B -->|Start| F["Resolve run choices; confirm inherited auto-deploy before claims"]
    F --> G["Admit safe ready tasks within 1-6 team limit and host capacity"]
    G --> H["Develop, review, repair in feature worktrees"]
    H --> I{"Checks and required version approval pass?"}
    I -->|No| J["Repair or hold; blocked/paused/approval-waiting teams retain slots"]
    J -->|Repair or explicit resume/approval| H
    I -->|Yes| K["Integrate serially; verify combined result; update main"]
    K --> L["Record delivery ID and boundary; free development slot"]
    L --> M{"Continuous, not held, and safe work ready?"}
    M -->|Yes| G
    M -->|No| N["Continue active work; finish fixed set or report exhaustion/blockers"]
    L -.-> O["Deployment batches proceed separately; no batch wait before refill"]
